Description Task 2: Download cadvisor binary based on version and checksum provided. This task is skipped when a local directory for a pre-downloaded binary is specified.

Task 3: cadvisor | propagate locally distributed cadvisor binary
Description Task 3: Copy the pre-downloaded cadvisor binary to the installation directory if a local directory is provided. This task triggers a service restart.

Task 4: cadvisor | symlink
Description Task 4: Create a symbolic link to the cadvisor binary for easy execution.

Task 5: cadvisor | server systemd service
Description Task 5: Create a systemd service file for cadvisor using a template.

Task 6: test_task
Description Task 6: Check if the cadvisor service is active and register the result.

Task 7: debug: var=service_active
Description Task 7: Debug the status of the cadvisor service.

Task 8: cadvisor | enable server systemd
Description Task 8: Enable the cadvisor systemd service for automatic startup.

Task 9: cadvisor | start server systemd
Description Task 9: Start the cadvisor systemd service and ensure it's running.


- Last generated (faulty) playbook: 
---
- name: Cadvisor | create directories
  ansible.builtin.file:
    path: "{{ item }}"
    state: directory
    mode: '0755'
  loop:
    - "{{ cadvisor_install_dir }}"
    - "{{ cadvisor_bin_dir }}"

- name: Cadvisor | download
  ansible.builtin.get_url:
    url: "{{ cadvisor_download_url }}"
    dest: "{{ cadvisor_bin_dir }}/cadvisor"
    mode: '0755'
    checksum: "{{ cadvisor_checksum }}"
  when: cadvisor_bin_local_dir is not defined or cadvisor_bin_local_dir == ''

- name: Cadvisor | propagate locally distributed cadvisor binary
  ansible.builtin.copy:
    src: "{{ cadvisor_bin_local_dir }}/cadvisor"
    dest: "{{ cadvisor_bin_dir }}/cadvisor"
    mode: '0755'
  when: cadvisor_bin_local_dir is defined and cadvisor_bin_local_dir != ''
  notify: Cadvisor | restart service

- name: Cadvisor | symlink
  ansible.builtin.file:
    src: "{{ cadvisor_bin_dir }}/cadvisor"
    dest: "/usr/local/bin/cadvisor"
    state: link
    force: true

- name: Cadvisor | server systemd service
  ansible.builtin.template:
    src: cadvisor.service.j2
    dest: /etc/systemd/system/cadvisor.service
    mode: '0644'
  notify: Cadvisor | reload systemd

- name: Test_task
  ansible.builtin.service_facts:
  register: service_active

- name: "Debug: var=service_active"
  ansible.builtin.debug:
    var: service_active

- name: Cadvisor | enable server systemd
  ansible.builtin.service:
    name: cadvisor
    enabled: true

- name: Cadvisor | start server systemd
  ansible.builtin.service:
    name: cadvisor
    state: started

- name: Cadvisor | restart service
  ansible.builtin.service:
    name: cadvisor
    state: restarted

- name: Cadvisor | reload systemd
  ansible.builtin.systemd:
    daemon_reload: yes


